90
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:53,544
如果你对解决这个问题真的充满热情
If you're really passionate about solving this problem,

91
00:04:53,544 --> 00:04:55,780
他们能感受得到，如果你不信我
they will be able to tell if you don't believe me.

