So let's talk about how to write a great sales email.

128
00:06:42,190 --> 00:06:44,992
第一，要简短，最多 6 到 8 句话。
So first, it should be short, max 6 to 8 sentences.

129
00:06:44,992 --> 00:06:48,410
上一页的 Brex 例子可能太长了。
The Brex example on the previous slide is probably too long.

130
00:06:48,570 --> 00:06:50,530
它还是奏效了，但可能太长。
It still worked, but probably too long.

131
00:06:51,050 --> 00:06:52,970
人们没时间读长邮件。
People don't have time to read long emails.

132
00:06:53,410 --> 00:06:56,570
如果你来自学术界，你的习惯会很不一样。
If you're coming out of academia, your culture is going to be very different.

133
00:06:56,690 --> 00:06:57,730
你会写很长的邮件。
You write very long emails.

134
00:06:58,170 --> 00:07:02,530
但在销售的世界里，你要尽量直奔主题、简洁明了。
But in the worlds of sales, you want to get to the point and be brief as much as you can.

135
00:07:02,730 --> 00:07:06,850
第二，要确保语言清晰，不用行话，不用流行词。
2. You want to make sure you have clear language, no jargon, no buzzwords.

136
00:07:07,090 --> 00:07:10,425
直接说清楚你做什么、它怎么运作。然后第三，
Just say exactly what you do and how it works. And then 3,

137
00:07:10,425 --> 00:07:14,050
针对潜在客户正面临的问题。
address the problem that the potential customer is having.

138
00:07:14,330 --> 00:07:16,099
第四，不要用任何 HTML 格式。
4, do not use any HTML formatting.

139
00:07:16,099 --> 00:07:19,890
只用纯文本写邮件，就像写给朋友一样。
Write your email in plain text only like you would written it to a friend.

140
00:07:20,330 --> 00:07:23,068
说明你是做这个产品的公司的创始人。
Say you are the founder of the company who makes this product.

141
00:07:23,068 --> 00:07:24,410
很多人会忘记这么做。
Many people forget to do this.

